{% doc %}
  @prompt
    Create a new section called “Featured Collection (2×2 Grid)” in the Bonne Soirée style — minimal, editorial, timeless, and clean.
    
    Functionality:
    
    Display 4 products from a selected collection by default.
    
    Products should automatically update if the collection changes.
    
    Layout:
    
    Desktop: 2 columns × 2 rows (default display of 4 products).
    
    Mobile: 2 columns × 2 rows (default display of 4 products).
    
    Maintain equal spacing between items — around 24px on desktop and 16px on mobile.
    
    Center the section on the page with soft side padding (40px desktop, 20px mobile).
    
    Product Card:
    
    Show product image, title, and price.
    
    Image ratio fixed to 4:5, using object-fit: cover.
    
    No rounded corners — images must have perfectly straight edges.
    
    border-radius: 0 !important;
    
    No shadows or borders; the layout should remain clean and minimal.
    
    Title and price left-aligned, using Times New Roman (or the store's primary serif font if available).
    
    Typography:
    
    Section title centered above the grid.
    
    Elegant serif typography consistent with Bonne Soirée branding.
    
    Plenty of white space between the title and the products.
    
    Settings:
    
    - Collection picker.
    - Section heading text.
    - Option to show or hide the section heading.
    - Product count selector (default: 4, minimum: 2, maximum: 8).
    
    The section must be fully responsive and compatible with Shopify Online Store 2.0., Adjust the product grid sizing.
    
    Keep the layout as 2 columns × 2 rows, but make the product cards smaller.
    
    Set the section container to a maximum width of 1200px on desktop and center it horizontally.
    
    Each product card should have a maximum width of approximately 480px.
    
    Do not stretch the product cards to fill the entire screen width.
    
    Keep the product image ratio at 4:5 with object-fit: cover.
    
    Maintain 24px spacing between products on desktop and 16px on mobile.
    
    On mobile, keep 2 columns, with cards fitting naturally within the screen width.
    
    Keep all other styling and functionality unchanged., The cards are too small and too far apart.
    
    Keep the layout as 2 columns × 2 rows, but make the grid occupy around 85% of the page width.
    
    Remove any max-width applied to the product cards.
    
    Center the grid and reduce the gap between columns to about 16–20px.
    
    I want the layout to look like a standard Shopify collection grid, with large product cards filling the columns naturally., Keep the current alignment, spacing, 2-column grid, and overall layout exactly as they are.
    
    Only reduce the size of the product images.
    
    Adjust the desktop grid container from approximately 980px to approximately 820px–860px maximum width.
    
    Each product image should be approximately 400px–420px wide on desktop.
    
    Keep:
    - 2 columns × 2 rows
    - the current gap between columns
    - the current centered alignment
    - the 4:5 image ratio
    - width: 100% inside each product card
    - object-fit: cover
    
    Do not change the product titles, prices, spacing between cards, or mobile layout.
    
    The only change should be making the product cards and images slightly smaller while keeping the grid compact and centered., Keep everything exactly as it is.
    
    Only reduce the overall size of the product cards by approximately 10%.
    
    Set the grid container max-width to approximately 780px.
    
    Keep:
    - the current alignment;
    - the current spacing between products;
    - the 2 × 2 layout;
    - the current typography;
    - the image ratio (4:5);
    - the current mobile layout.
    
    Do not change anything else.
{% enddoc %}
{% assign ai_gen_id = block.id | replace: '_', '' | downcase %}

{% style %}
  .ai-featured-collection-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
    padding: 0 40px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  @media screen and (max-width: 749px) {
    .ai-featured-collection-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      padding: 0 20px;
    }
  }

  .ai-featured-collection__header-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    text-align: center;
    margin-bottom: 60px;
  }

  @media screen and (max-width: 749px) {
    .ai-featured-collection__header-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      margin-bottom: 40px;
    }
  }

  .ai-featured-collection__title-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;
    font-size: 32px;
    font-weight: 400;
    letter-spacing: 0.5px;
    margin: 0;
    color: {{ block.settings.heading_color }};
  }

  @media screen and (max-width: 749px) {
    .ai-featured-collection__title-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      font-size: 24px;
    }
  }

  .ai-featured-collection__grid-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
    gap: 24px 18px;
    max-width: 780px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  @media screen and (max-width: 749px) {
    .ai-featured-collection__grid-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      gap: 16px;
      max-width: 100%;
    }
  }

  .ai-featured-collection__product-card-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    text-decoration: none;
    color: inherit;
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
  }

  .ai-featured-collection__image-wrapper-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    position: relative;
    width: 100%;
    padding-bottom: 125%;
    overflow: hidden;
    margin-bottom: 12px;
    border-radius: 0 !important;
  }

  .ai-featured-collection__image-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    position: absolute;
    top: 0;
    left: 0;
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    object-fit: cover;
    border-radius: 0 !important;
  }

  .ai-featured-collection__product-info-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    text-align: left;
  }

  .ai-featured-collection__product-title-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;
    font-size: 16px;
    font-weight: 400;
    margin: 0 0 6px 0;
    color: {{ block.settings.product_title_color }};
    line-height: 1.4;
  }

  @media screen and (max-width: 749px) {
    .ai-featured-collection__product-title-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      font-size: 14px;
    }
  }

  .ai-featured-collection__product-price-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;
    font-size: 14px;
    font-weight: 400;
    color: {{ block.settings.product_price_color }};
    margin: 0;
  }

  @media screen and (max-width: 749px) {
    .ai-featured-collection__product-price-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      font-size: 13px;
    }
  }

  .ai-featured-collection__empty-state-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    text-align: center;
    padding: 60px 20px;
    color: #999;
    font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;
    font-size: 16px;
  }
{% endstyle %}

<featured-collection-{{ ai_gen_id }}
  class="ai-featured-collection-{{ ai_gen_id }}"
  {{ block.shopify_attributes }}
>
  {% if block.settings.show_heading and block.settings.heading != blank %}
    <div class="ai-featured-collection__header-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
      <h2 class="ai-featured-collection__title-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{{ block.settings.heading }}</h2>
    </div>
  {% endif %}

  {% if block.settings.collection != blank %}
    {% assign products_to_show = block.settings.product_count %}
    {% assign collection_products = block.settings.collection.products %}
    
    {% if collection_products.size > 0 %}
      <div class="ai-featured-collection__grid-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
        {% for product in collection_products limit: products_to_show %}
          <a
            href="{{ product.url }}"
            class="ai-featured-collection__product-card-{{ ai_gen_id }}"
          >
            <div class="ai-featured-collection__image-wrapper-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
              {% if product.featured_image %}
                <img
                  src="{{ product.featured_image | image_url: width: 800 }}"
                  alt="{{ product.featured_image.alt | escape }}"
                  class="ai-featured-collection__image-{{ ai_gen_id }}"
                  loading="lazy"
                  width="{{ product.featured_image.width }}"
                  height="{{ product.featured_image.height }}"
                >
              {% else %}
                <div class="ai-featured-collection__image-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
                  {{ 'product-1' | placeholder_svg_tag }}
                </div>
              {% endif %}
            </div>
            <div class="ai-featured-collection__product-info-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
              <h3 class="ai-featured-collection__product-title-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
                {{ product.title }}
              </h3>
              <div class="ai-featured-collection__product-price-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
                {{ product.price | money }}
              </div>
            </div>
          </a>
        {% endfor %}
      </div>
    {% else %}
      <div class="ai-featured-collection__empty-state-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
        The selected collection has no products.
      </div>
    {% endif %}
  {% else %}
    <div class="ai-featured-collection__empty-state-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
      Select a collection to display products.
    </div>
  {% endif %}
</featured-collection-{{ ai_gen_id }}>

<script>
  (function() {
    class FeaturedCollection{{ ai_gen_id }} extends HTMLElement {
      constructor() {
        super();
      }

      connectedCallback() {
      }
    }

    customElements.define('featured-collection-{{ ai_gen_id }}', FeaturedCollection{{ ai_gen_id }});
  })();
</script>

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "Featured collection grid",
  "tag": null,
  "settings": [
    {
      "type": "header",
      "content": "Collection"
    },
    {
      "type": "collection",
      "id": "collection",
      "label": "Collection"
    },
    {
      "type": "range",
      "id": "product_count",
      "min": 2,
      "max": 8,
      "step": 1,
      "label": "Products to show",
      "default": 4
    },
    {
      "type": "header",
      "content": "Heading"
    },
    {
      "type": "checkbox",
      "id": "show_heading",
      "label": "Show heading",
      "default": true
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "heading",
      "label": "Heading text",
      "default": "Featured Collection"
    },
    {
      "type": "color",
      "id": "heading_color",
      "label": "Heading color",
      "default": "#000000"
    },
    {
      "type": "header",
      "content": "Product card"
    },
    {
      "type": "color",
      "id": "product_title_color",
      "label": "Title color",
      "default": "#000000"
    },
    {
      "type": "color",
      "id": "product_price_color",
      "label": "Price color",
      "default": "#000000"
    }
  ],
  "presets": [
    {
      "name": "Featured collection grid"
    }
  ]
}
{% endschema %}
